    <description>PDD-10: Guided intake for a new Dispute/Claim, launched from the New Dispute/Claim quick action on Contact. Creates a Disputes_Claims Case (Account taken from the Contact; fallback to DCC_Generic_Intake_Queue when there is no Account), an optional primary DCC_Invoice_Numbers__c record with a warn-only duplicate check, sets DCC_SLA_Type__c from DCC_Issue_Type_Mapping__mdt, and optionally sends the customer acknowledgement email.</description>
